#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/usb-tether/setting.js
msgid "Active exit: %s (metric %d). Lower the metric in Settings to prefer the phone."
msgstr "当前出口：%s(metric %d)。在「设置」里调低 metric 可优先走手机。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/usb-tether/status.js
msgid "Check that USB tethering is switched on on the phone."
msgstr "请确认手机上的 USB 网络共享已开启。"

msgid "configured"
msgstr "当前配置"

msgid "Connected"
msgstr "已连接"

msgid "Current Exit"
msgstr "当前上网出口"

msgid "default"
msgstr "默认"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/usb-tether/setting.js
msgid "Default 50 = standby (fallback): the phone is used only when other WAN connections are down. Set a lower value than your main WAN to make the phone the primary exit."
msgstr "默认 50 = 备援待命：仅当其他 WAN 断开时才走手机。调到比主 WAN 更低的值即可让手机成为主出口。"

msgid "Detected"
msgstr "已检测到"

msgid "Detected other USB devices: %s"
msgstr "检测到其他 USB 网卡：%s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/usb-tether/setting.js
msgid "Detected USB network devices. Phones expose RNDIS / CDC-NCM / CDC-Ether (Android) or ipheth (iPhone) once USB tethering is switched on."
msgstr "检测到的 USB 网卡。手机开启 USB 网络共享后会枚举出 RNDIS / CDC-NCM / CDC-Ether(安卓)或 ipheth(iPhone)网卡。"

msgid "Device present, waiting for DHCP …"
msgstr "设备在位，等待 DHCP 获取地址 …"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "未启用"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Enabled, waiting for device …"
msgstr "已启用，等待设备插入 …"

msgid "Failed to apply USB tethering settings: %s"
msgstr "应用 USB 共享上网设置失败：%s"

msgid "Firewall Zone"
msgstr "防火墙区域"

msgid "Firewall zone for the tethering interface. Keep it in the WAN zone unless you know what you are doing."
msgstr "共享上网接口所属的防火墙区域。除非清楚后果，请保持 wan 区域。"

msgid "Gateway"
msgstr "网关"

msgid "Interface"
msgstr "接口"

msgid "in use"
msgstr "占用"

msgid "IPv4 Address"
msgstr "IPv4 地址"

msgid "IPv6 Address"
msgstr "IPv6 地址"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/usb-tether/status.js
msgid "Live status of the internet connection shared over USB from a phone. Values refresh every few seconds. Supported drivers: RNDIS, CDC-NCM, CDC-Ether (Android), ipheth (iPhone)."
msgstr "通过 USB 从手机共享的网络连接的实时状态，数值每几秒自动刷新。支持驱动：RNDIS、CDC-NCM、CDC-Ether(安卓)、ipheth(iPhone)。"

msgid "modem device"
msgstr "模组设备"

msgid "Modem device"
msgstr "模组设备"

msgid "No default route present"
msgstr "当前无默认路由"

msgid "Not detected"
msgstr "未检测到"

msgid "Phone (%s) — active"
msgstr "手机(%s)— 使用中"

msgid "Phone / USB Device"
msgstr "手机 / USB 设备"

msgid "Plug the phone into the router USB port and enable USB tethering on the phone, then select the device in Settings."
msgstr "请将手机插到路由器 USB 口，在手机上开启 USB 网络共享，然后在「设置」页选择对应设备。"

msgid "Route Metric"
msgstr "路由 Metric"

msgid "Standby (metric %d)"
msgstr "备援待命(metric %d)"

msgid "This device looks like a 5G modem data port. Pick another one in Settings."
msgstr "该设备疑似 5G 模组数据口，请在「设置」页改选其他设备。"

msgid "Total Download"
msgstr "累计下载"

msgid "Total Upload"
msgstr "累计上传"

msgid "Traffic is currently routed through the phone."
msgstr "当前流量正通过手机上网。"

msgid "USB Device"
msgstr "USB 设备"

msgid "USB Tethering"
msgstr "USB 共享上网"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/usb-tether/setting.js
msgid "Use your phone as a WAN source: connect it to the router USB port, enable USB tethering on the phone, then turn this feature on. The router obtains internet access from the phone via DHCP."
msgstr "把手机当作路由器的上网来源：手机插到路由器 USB 口并开启 USB 网络共享后，打开本开关，路由器即通过 DHCP 经手机上网。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/usb-tether/setting.js
msgid "When enabled, a DHCP interface on the selected USB device is created and attached to the chosen firewall zone (metric applies). Re-enabling after unplugging the phone requires no further action — the interface follows the device automatically."
msgstr "开启后会在所选 USB 设备上创建 DHCP 接口并加入所选防火墙区域(metric 生效)。拔掉手机后重新插上无需任何操作——接口自动跟随设备恢复。"

